WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:03,430
This person is full of murderous intentions and extraordinary strength

2
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:06,230
If I can surrender, I will definitely be interested in the lady.

3
00:00:06,230 --> 00:00:10,670
If it cannot be surrendered, it must be eradicated as soon as possible

4
00:00:10,670 --> 00:00:15,350
Don't let it fall into the hands of your brothers

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:19,420
What are you doing with these things?

6
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:24,800
We just went to see the excitement

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:31,030
don't be angry

8
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:34,540
The sect has sent you to get rid of Gu Shiyi this time.

9
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,620
Maybe they have some unspeakable meaning

10
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,540
Unspeakable meaning

11
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:47,540
They are afraid that I will fall from my position as the Ten and Five Saints.

12
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:49,740
I got lost and saw his traces

13
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:52,780
I know you really want to fight him openly

14
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,580
But the sect issued a death order

15
00:00:54,580 --> 00:00:57,750
this is the last time

16
00:00:57,750 --> 00:00:59,390
Isn’t this Brother Wu?

17
00:00:59,390 --> 00:01:01,550
Long time no see. Have you ever been well?

18
00:01:01,550 --> 00:01:03,470
How about a cup of Xiaozhuo?

19
00:01:03,470 --> 00:01:08,530
I advise Brother Wu Ya

20
00:01:08,530 --> 00:01:10,000
It's really you
